---
// Bento grid of governance guarantees, each card carrying a bespoke HTML/CSS
// visual: the finding object, the data boundary, the review gate, the compile
// fan-out, the two update paths, honest zero-finding runs, and per-host
// enrollment. Facts: key-concepts, understand-findings, trust-and-data-model,
// remediate-findings, supported-agents, manage-updates-and-recovery.
---

<section
  id="pig-governance"
  class="pig-section pig-bento"
  aria-labelledby="pig-bento-title"
  data-section-tracked="agent-governance"
>
  <div class="pig-section-head" data-pig-reveal>
    <p class="pig-eyebrow">Governance</p>
    <h2 id="pig-bento-title" class="pig-h2">Evidence In. Reviewed Change Out.</h2>
    <p class="pig-sub">Findings cite the sessions that prove them. Fixes arrive as pull requests. Traces stay in your cluster, and collection is off until you turn it on.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pig-bento-grid">
    <!-- Row 1 -->
    <article class="pig-card pig-bento-card is-w41" data-pig-reveal>
      <h3 class="pig-h3">What a finding contains</h3>
      <p class="pig-body">Severity says how much a failure costs; confidence says how sure the evidence is. Every finding cites the sessions that show it and the exact commit the analyzer read.</p>
      <div class="pig-filetable" role="img" aria-label="A finding record: severity high, confidence high, instruction failure review-docs omits the version check, evidence 4 sessions, source acme-instruction-hub at commit 7f3a9c">
        <div class="pig-filetable-bar">
          <span class="pig-filetable-name">finding_3f2a.json</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pig-filetable-row"><span>severity</span><span class="pig-pill-warn">high</span></div>
        <div class="pig-filetable-row"><span>confidence</span><span class="pig-pill-ok">high</span></div>
        <div class="pig-filetable-row"><span>instruction failure</span><span>review-docs omits version check</span></div>
        <div class="pig-filetable-row"><span>evidence</span><span>4 sessions · digest 118–142</span></div>
        <div class="pig-filetable-row"><span>source</span><span>acme-instruction-hub@7f3a9c</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="pig-card pig-bento-card is-w59" data-pig-reveal style="--pig-reveal-delay: 80ms">
      <h3 class="pig-h3">What stays in your cluster</h3>
      <p class="pig-body">Raw session logs and normalized traces live in your bucket and your PostgreSQL. Your model provider receives analysis input from your cluster. Promptless gets identifiers, counts, and status, plus findings, which can describe session details.</p>
      <div class="pig-boundary" role="img" aria-label="Two panes. Left, trace_raw.jsonl with prompt, tool calls, file excerpts, working directory and git metadata, labeled stays in your bucket and PostgreSQL. Right, the status projection sent to Promptless with trace id, host, status analyzed, 42 turns, 188 events. Prompts, tool output, cwd, and git metadata are never sent.">
        <div class="pig-boundary-pane">
          <div class="pig-boundary-head">trace_raw.jsonl · your bucket</div>
          <div class="pig-boundary-kv"><span>t.prompt</span><em>"fix the failing auth test"</em></div>
          <div class="pig-boundary-kv"><span>t.tool_calls</span><em>[ …raw args, outputs ]</em></div>
          <div class="pig-boundary-kv"><span>t.file_excerpts</span><em>billing/refund.py …</em></div>
          <div class="pig-boundary-kv"><span>t.cwd</span><em>/Users/jordan/billing-svc</em></div>
          <div class="pig-boundary-kv"><span>t.git</span><em>acme/billing-svc@e41d…</em></div>
          <div class="pig-boundary-label">Stays in your bucket and PostgreSQL</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pig-boundary-pane is-out">
          <div class="pig-boundary-head">status_projection.json · to Promptless</div>
          <pre class="pig-boundary-code"><code>{`{
  "trace_id": "tr_8f2e1a9c",
  "host":     "claude · jordan-mbp",
  "status":   "analyzed",
  "turns":    42,
  "events":   188
}`}
<span class="pig-t-comment"># prompts, tool output, cwd, git metadata: never sent</span></code></pre>
          <div class="pig-boundary-label is-out">Status projection to Promptless</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Row 2 -->
    <article class="pig-card pig-bento-card" data-pig-reveal>
      <h3 class="pig-h3">Review before it ships</h3>
      <p class="pig-body">The remediation agent works in an isolated checkout and opens the pull request. Merge stays yours. Promptless never merges for you.</p>
      <div class="pig-pr" role="img" aria-label="A pull request titled fix(review-docs): check product version before approving, with pig verify passing, CODEOWNERS docs-team, and 2 approvals required">
        <div class="pig-pr-title"><span class="pig-pr-icon" aria-hidden="true">⎇</span>fix(review-docs): check product version before approving</div>
        <div class="pig-pr-meta pig-mono">remediation/3f2a → main · +14 −3</div>
        <ul class="pig-pr-checks pig-mono">
          <li><span class="pig-t-ok">✓</span> pig verify · release 0.1.1-2c9e</li>
          <li><span class="pig-t-ok">✓</span> CODEOWNERS · docs-team</li>
          <li><span class="pig-t-warn">○</span> 2 approvals required</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="pig-pr-foot pig-mono"><span>Merge</span><span class="pig-pr-gate">Waiting on review</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="pig-card pig-bento-card" data-pig-reveal style="--pig-reveal-delay: 70ms">
      <h3 class="pig-h3">Not every finding becomes a PR</h3>
      <p class="pig-body">When a missing tool, permission, or credential is the cause, remediation records the owner instead. When the cause is uncertain, it says so and opens nothing.</p>
      <ul class="pig-outcomes pig-mono" role="img" aria-label="Four remediation outcomes: a focused pull request, a decision requested in Slack, an external owner recorded, or cause uncertain with no pull request">
        <li><span class="pig-t-ok">✓</span><span>hub owns the cause</span><span class="pig-outcomes-r">focused PR</span></li>
        <li><span class="pig-t-warn">?</span><span>needs a policy call</span><span class="pig-outcomes-r">decision in Slack</span></li>
        <li><span class="pig-t-dim">→</span><span>tool or credential</span><span class="pig-outcomes-r">owner recorded</span></li>
        <li><span class="pig-t-dim">·</span><span>cause uncertain</span><span class="pig-outcomes-r">no PR</span></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="pig-card pig-bento-card" data-pig-reveal style="--pig-reveal-delay: 140ms">
      <h3 class="pig-h3">Two update paths</h3>
      <p class="pig-body">Instruction releases change what your agents install. Analyzer releases change the service in your cluster. Ship either without touching the other.</p>
      <div class="pig-paths pig-mono" role="img" aria-label="Instruction releases flow hub to CI to release/stable to refreshed plugins. Analyzer releases auto-update to stable and can be paused or pinned.">
        <div class="pig-path">
          <span class="pig-path-label">Instructions</span>
          <span class="pig-path-steps"><b>hub</b><i></i><b>CI</b><i></i><b>release/stable</b><i></i><b>your agents</b></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pig-path">
          <span class="pig-path-label">Analyzer</span>
          <span class="pig-path-steps"><b>stable</b><i></i><b class="is-ok">auto-update</b><span class="pig-path-alt">· pause · pin</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Row 3 -->
    <article class="pig-card pig-bento-card is-half" data-pig-reveal>
      <h3 class="pig-h3">Zero findings is a valid result</h3>
      <p class="pig-body">A completed analysis can find nothing. The analyzer reports that instead of inventing a change, and later sessions can promote a low-confidence finding when the evidence arrives.</p>
      <ul class="pig-runs pig-mono" role="img" aria-label="Analysis runs: session 7a1 analyzed with 0 findings, session 7a2 with 1 finding of high severity and high confidence, session 7a3 with 0 findings, session 7a4 with 1 finding of medium severity and low confidence">
        <li><span>sess_7a1</span><span>analyzed</span><span class="pig-runs-n">0 findings</span></li>
        <li><span>sess_7a2</span><span>analyzed</span><span class="pig-runs-n is-hit">1 finding · high / high</span></li>
        <li><span>sess_7a3</span><span>analyzed</span><span class="pig-runs-n">0 findings</span></li>
        <li><span>sess_7a4</span><span>analyzed</span><span class="pig-runs-n is-hit">1 finding · medium / low</span></li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="pig-card pig-bento-card is-half" data-pig-reveal style="--pig-reveal-delay: 80ms">
      <h3 class="pig-h3">Enrollment is per host</h3>
      <p class="pig-body">A signed-in member approves each host in the browser. Every host gets its own credential, uploads over HTTPS to your analyzer, and can be reset without touching the rest.</p>
      <div class="pig-enroll" role="img" aria-label="An enrollment approval card for host jordan-mbp running claude against deployment prod-eks, with an approve button, then a credential stored locally as plihost.">
        <div class="pig-enroll-card">
          <div class="pig-enroll-head pig-mono">app.gopromptless.ai/instruction-hub/enroll</div>
          <div class="pig-enroll-body">
            <div class="pig-enroll-kv pig-mono"><span>host</span><b>jordan-mbp · claude</b></div>
            <div class="pig-enroll-kv pig-mono"><span>deployment</span><b>prod-eks · traces.acme.example</b></div>
            <div class="pig-enroll-kv pig-mono"><span>approver</span><b>jordan@acme.com</b></div>
            <span class="pig-enroll-btn pig-mono">Approve host</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pig-enroll-result pig-mono"><span class="pig-t-ok">✓</span> plihost_…  stored locally, owner-only</div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="pig-bento-note pig-mono" data-pig-reveal>Example records from a sample hub (Acme).</p>
</section>

<style>
  .pig-bento-note {
    margin: clamp(1rem, 3vh, 1.5rem) 0 0;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-500);
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pig-bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .pig-bento-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    grid-column: span 2;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.8rem);
  }

  .pig-bento-card.is-w41 { grid-column: span 2; }
  .pig-bento-card.is-w59 { grid-column: span 4; }
  .pig-bento-card.is-half { grid-column: span 3; }

  .pig-bento-card .pig-body {
    max-width: 96%;
  }

  .pig-bento-card > [role='img'],
  .pig-bento-card > ul[role='img'] {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* File table (finding record) */
  .pig-filetable {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: var(--pig-surface-panel);
    box-shadow: var(--pig-shadow-soft), var(--pig-inset-soft);
    font-family: var(--pig-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-code);
  }

  .pig-bento-card > .pig-filetable { padding-top: 0; }

  .pig-filetable-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.95rem;
  }

  .pig-filetable-name {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--pig-green);
  }

  .pig-filetable-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.95rem;
  }

  .pig-filetable-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .pig-filetable-row > span:first-child { color: var(--pig-zinc-500); }
  .pig-filetable-row > span:last-child { color: var(--pig-zinc-300); text-align: right; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  .pig-pill-warn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 163, 77, 0.35);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: rgba(232, 163, 77, 0.12);
    color: var(--pig-amber) !important;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
  }

  /* Data boundary compare */
  .pig-boundary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--pig-font-mono);
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
  }

  .pig-boundary-pane {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: var(--pig-surface-panel);
    padding: 0.85rem 0.95rem 0.8rem;
    box-shadow: var(--pig-inset-soft);
  }

  .pig-boundary-pane.is-out {
    border-color: rgba(39, 201, 63, 0.25);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(39, 201, 63, 0.05), transparent 45%), var(--pig-surface-panel);
  }

  .pig-boundary-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-300);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .pig-boundary-kv {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-500);
  }

  .pig-boundary-kv em {
    color: var(--pig-zinc-300);
    font-style: normal;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .pig-boundary-code {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-300);
    font-size: inherit;
    line-height: 1.55;
    white-space: pre;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }

  .pig-boundary-code::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  .pig-boundary-code .pig-t-comment {
    display: block;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .pig-boundary-label {
    margin-top: auto;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    padding-top: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-400);
    letter-spacing: var(--pig-track-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pig-boundary-label.is-out {
    color: var(--pig-green);
    border-top-color: rgba(39, 201, 63, 0.25);
  }

  /* Pull request */
  .pig-pr {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: var(--pig-surface-panel);
    padding: 0.9rem 0.95rem;
    box-shadow: var(--pig-inset-soft);
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
  }

  .pig-pr-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-100);
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-sm);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .pig-pr-icon { color: var(--pig-purple); }
  .pig-pr-meta { color: var(--pig-zinc-500); }

  .pig-pr-checks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-300);
  }

  .pig-pr-checks li { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }

  .pig-pr-foot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-500);
  }

  .pig-pr-gate {
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 163, 77, 0.35);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: rgba(232, 163, 77, 0.1);
    color: var(--pig-amber);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Update paths */
  .pig-paths {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
  }

  .pig-path {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: var(--pig-surface-panel);
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
  }

  .pig-path-label {
    color: var(--pig-zinc-500);
    letter-spacing: var(--pig-track-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pig-path-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-200);
  }

  .pig-path-steps b { font-weight: 500; }
  .pig-path-steps b.is-ok { color: var(--pig-green); }
  .pig-path-steps i { display: inline-block; width: 0.9rem; height: 1px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); }
  .pig-path-alt { color: var(--pig-zinc-500); }

  /* Remediation outcomes */
  .pig-outcomes {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
  }



  .pig-outcomes li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: var(--pig-surface-panel);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-400);
  }

  .pig-outcomes-r { color: var(--pig-zinc-200); }
  .pig-outcomes li:first-child .pig-outcomes-r { color: var(--pig-green); }

  /* Runs list */
  .pig-runs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
  }



  .pig-runs li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 5.5rem 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: var(--pig-surface-panel);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-400);
  }

  .pig-runs-n { color: var(--pig-zinc-500); }
  .pig-runs-n.is-hit { color: var(--pig-amber); }

  /* Enrollment */
  .pig-enroll {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    font-size: var(--pig-fs-xs);
  }

  .pig-enroll-card {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: var(--pig-surface-panel);
    box-shadow: var(--pig-inset-soft);
  }

  .pig-enroll-head {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pig-line-soft);
    background: #000;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-500);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .pig-enroll-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.8rem;
  }

  .pig-enroll-kv {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-500);
  }

  .pig-enroll-kv b { color: var(--pig-zinc-200); font-weight: 500; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  .pig-enroll-btn {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--pig-r-sm);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-200);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pig-enroll-result {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--pig-zinc-300);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .pig-bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .pig-bento-card,
    .pig-bento-card.is-w41,
    .pig-bento-card.is-w59,
    .pig-bento-card.is-half {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }

    .pig-bento-card.is-w59 {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pig-bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }


    .pig-bento-card,
    .pig-bento-card.is-w59 {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }

    .pig-boundary {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
